  "description": "Particle detectors for measuring energetic charged particles (electrons, protons, ions) in space plasmas and cosmic rays. Includes solid-state silicon detectors, proportional counters, time-of-flight systems, and microchannel plates. Heritage from Van Allen probes, Solar Orbiter, and cosmic-ray observatories.",
